The m88k code requires natural alignment: a halfword at `0x29` and a doubleword at an offset that is 4 mod 8 never reach VME. Enumeration confirms the 10/26/988 word-start census, plus 104 reachable subword combinations inside population-2 words. Those need explicit interim wording, and the proposed “no register is defined here” comment is too broad.
